  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1749498536_2127246_5a493fe5ff5952f5681802c3e937aae9.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products:&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Sunstone Permanent Jewelry is a leading provider of innovative solutions in the permanent jewelry industry. With a dedication to excellence and a focus on cutting-edge technology, Sunstone Welders has established itself as a trusted name for permanent jewelry artists. The company offers a wide range of products and services designed to help permanent jewelry artists build their world.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Sunstone is a one stop shop for everything related to permanent jewelry: Supplies, business coaching, online training, consumable retail products.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Affiliates are welcome to promote any or all of our products and services, whichever fits best within their realm of influence. The opportunity to earn significant commission is very real—Sunstone's all-in-one permanent jewelry starter kit has a price tag of more than $5,000. You can easily realize commission checks with at least one comma! And the permanent jewelry industry is growing. New artists are getting started all the time.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Blogs, social media, reels, Facebook groups, email marketing—any marketing push you do can be effective! Just leverage your knowledge and influence to promote the permanent jewelry opportunity.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>Other information:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">We are open to discussing commission percentage increases as results show!</p></div></div>",
